---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en" data-theme="dark" style="color-scheme:dark">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <title>Privacy Policy | ByteCrafters</title>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
        <meta name="theme-color" content="#05050a" />
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    </head>
    <body class="tech-bg">
        <Navbar />

        <main style="max-width: 900px; margin: 120px auto 5rem auto; padding: 0 2rem; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.8;">
            <h1 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last updated: November 2026</p>

            <h2 style="color: #00d2ff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>ByteCrafters is committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our services.</p>

            <h2 style="color: #00d2ff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>When you browse our site or fill out our contact form, we may collect:</p>
            <ul style="list-style: disc; margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <li>Name or Company Name</li>
                <li>Email address</li>
                <li>Phone number (if provided)</li>
                <li>Browsing data and IP address</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 style="color: #00d2ff; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">3. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please feel free to reach out via our contact page.</p>
        </main>

        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>